    # r99 AnimationTree/AnimationNodeBlendTree lattice: r99_animtree.gd
    # drives byte-identical copies of the r99 boundary probes (res://
    # r99_probe_r99b_*.gd, recopied into each child as res://r99b_*.gd) as
    # bounded children in fresh per-cell projects across GodotPhysics,
    # Jolt, and Dummy at --fixed-fps 60. Normalized child streams hash
    # identically on every backend (beq=1); Dummy differs only in
    # server-side reads (srv=nil). Expected engine ERROR lines stay in
    # the hash and are counted (ee=). clsloop carries td=teardown-tolerant
    # rc (0|134) because a rare host heap abort can fire during engine
    # shutdown AFTER the arm marker; its hashed stream is truncated at the
